  "name": "AWS Bedrock",
  "label": "AWS Bedrock",
  "description": "Official Amazon Bedrock Runtime REST (Converse + InvokeModel) and ListFoundationModels on the v2 agent model contract (INPUT llm_input → OUTPUT llm_output). Auth is AWS SigV4 (signing name bedrock) using config access_key + secret_access_key. Image/document parts use type file (platform ref-id). Docs: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/bedrock/latest/APIReference/API_runtime_Converse.html. Terms: https://aws.amazon.com/agreement/. Never log access_key or secret_access_key. Errors raise a BPMN error for the error boundary event (INVALID_INPUT, AUTH_FAILED, RATE_LIMITED, HTTP_<status>, REQUEST_FAILED); secrets are redacted.",
  "icon": "psychology",
